    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a53318a48c16e50a207b764",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目送返回集训宿舍的杏目，\n我无意间将视线投向海滩。集训已进入尾声，\n大部分赛马娘都进入了最后调整阶段――",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb063a03d2ad29cc7addfaf6b4cc775e9bbd483b1e10004650058c77f12ae19d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
