      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "的确，能做到的话――确实无人能敌了。\n……就能君临天下了。那样的话，我就能――！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f604a4a40db9184450bbc33468638f5e1df0147dd78560ad468ad0ce51fa699",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
